<title>SPAIN: Acerinox to pay interim 100 pta gross div.</title>
<headline>Acerinox to pay interim 100 pta gross div.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish steel producer Acerinox said on Thursday it would pay a second interim dividend of 100 pesetas gross per share, effective January 3.</p>
<p>In October, the company paid an interim 100 pesetas gross dividend per share.</p>
<p>Last year Acerinox also paid two interim dividends of 100 pesetas per share each, which were followed by a final dividend of 200 pesetas per share.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company also said it had set up a subsidiary in Australia.</p>
<p>It provided no further details.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
